00:58:25.240 --> 00:58:34.290
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, people ask me all the time, what's he really like? and I think they have finally figured out a way to get it across.

00:58:34.290 --> 00:58:39.430
<v Kevin O'leary>Imagine a tiny, little, white lady, with the temper and fashion sense of Mr. T, and you get the idea.

00:58:39.430 --> 00:58:54.630
